shape: sequence_diagram

client: AA Mobile Client
fastapi: FastAPI
di: Dependency Injection
factory: AsyncSession Factory
session: AsyncSession
repo: Repository
service: Application Service
router: Route Handler

client -> fastapi: HTTP request

fastapi -> di: Resolve declared dependencies

di -> factory: Create request-scoped session
factory -> di: AsyncSession instance

di -> repo: Construct repository with session
di -> service: Construct service with repository

di -> fastapi: Supply resolved dependencies

fastapi -> router: Invoke route handler with service

router -> service: Execute use case

service -> repo: Execute persistence operation
repo -> session: Execute database operation
session -> repo: Database result
repo -> service: Domain or persistence result

service -> router: Return use-case result
router -> fastapi: Return response model

fastapi -> client: HTTP response

fastapi -> di: Finalize request dependencies
di -> session: Close session and release resources